<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates end at 20.50 pct in calm trade.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates end at 20.50 pct in calm trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates on Friday closed above Thursday's last price in what dealers called a quite session.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at 20.50 percent, compared to 20.50/21.00 at opening, but up from Thursday's close of 20.25.</p>
<p>Dealers said they did not see any market moving factors with tax payments, normally due on the 10th of the month, had not any impact either.</p>
